ValueSet: MII_VS_Mikrobio_LOINC_Ontology_General_Culture_Identity
Id: mii-vs-mikrobio-loinc-ontology-general-culture-identity
Title: "MII VS Microbiology LOINC Ontology General Culture Identity"
Description: "Proposal: LOINC codes of the microbiology request 'General culture: General culture — organism identity by culture technique', computed by ECL over the LOINC Ontology 2026-10-21. What the generic culture request returns: nominal identification of any organism by any culture technique (microbial, organism specific, anaerobic, fungal ...). Contains 11475-1. Parts: LOINC enumeration (577, LOINC 2.83), LOINC Ontology observables without LOINC code (1), and the ECL as an intensional include. ECL: `<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = 118584009 |Presence or identity (property) (qualifier value)|, 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = << 703725008 |Culture technique (qualifier value)|, (704319004 |Inheres in (attribute)| = << 410607006 |Organism (organism)| OR 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = << 410607006 |Organism (organism)|)`"
* insert PR_CS_VS_Version
* insert Publisher
* insert SnomedLicense
* ^status = #draft
* ^experimental = true
* ^date = "2026-11-03"
* ^purpose = "Guidance for binding Observation.code of the MII microbiology request profiles to a computably defined LOINC set; accompanies ballot comments on 2027.0.0-ballot2. Generated, not hand-curated."
